  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health/dispatch_delivery.rs:58-72 (dispatch_send, renamed from dispatch_compose_send) still branches on request.acknowledges_message_id.is_some() && request.source_remote_host.is_none() into two separate downstream execution/finalization paths (ack_mail_with_runtime_... vs send_mail_with_runtime_...) producing AckOutcome vs SendOutcome. Corroborated by req-qa citing the same pattern as an open ladder-wide finding (AG18-QA-003) across every sub-sprint branch s18-s25. quality-mgr resolved this as blocking (not a licensed ack-as-data carve-out) given the ladder's prior consistent treatment of this exact pattern as blocking." ;
